# Python-generated files
__pycache__/
*.py[oc]
build/
dist/
wheels/
*.egg-info
.eggs/

# Virtual environments. uv makes .venv; teammates on plain pip often name
# theirs venv/ or env/, so ignore those too rather than have one land in a PR.
.venv
venv/
env/
ENV/

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# NOT ignored, on purpose:
#   uv.lock                 a lockfile exists to be shared; pip users just
#                           ignore the file, it costs them nothing
#   .python-version         pins 3.12 -- and matters MORE for pip users, who do
#                           not get the interpreter picked for them
#   calib/intrinsics.json   shared: the team is on one rig. If you end up on
#                           different webcams, ignore it -- the loader only
#                           rejects a mismatched RESOLUTION, so two cameras both
#                           at 1280x720 would silently share one wrong fx.
